{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/bf87155c5f3d4fc51644f3d2683d717d.avif?t=1762773645\" width=1500 height=500 /></span>\ud83c\udf28\ufe0f <strong>North Hunt | The Viking Evolution of West Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You thought you mastered the Wild West\u2026 now try surviving the North.<br>From the creators of <i>West Hunt</i>, <strong>North Hunt</strong> throws you into a Viking-age village where every villager could be a thief in disguise and every mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Snow crunches under your boots. Someone nearby is fishing... or pretending to. You look again \u2014 too late. The hunt has already begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built on the chaotic fun that made <i>West Hunt</i> a hit, <strong>North Hunt</strong> is a complete evolution: new systems, smarter A.I., and a world that turns social deception into an art form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/d7b272a10a2881b32d1f7608d59911a7.poster.avif?t=1762773645\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/d7b272a10a2881b32d1f7608d59911a7.webm?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/d7b272a10a2881b32d1f7608d59911a7.mp4?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Precision Counts. Fail, and You\u2019re Fish Bait</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Skill checks now decide your fate <strong>one slip,</strong> <strong>one mistimed move</strong>, and suspicion spreads like wildfire. Every mission you complete pulls you deeper into the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/adf01531f95ab4bda89a52355f26031e.poster.avif?t=1762773645\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/adf01531f95ab4bda89a52355f26031e.webm?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/adf01531f95ab4bda89a52355f26031e.mp4?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Chief or Thief | Choose Your Side</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play as the cunning <strong>Thief</strong> blending into the village or the fearless <strong>Chief</strong> hunting down impostors. Each class has new powers, perks, and ways to outsmart the other, <strong><i>no two hunts are ever the same</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/cf149d9c329cc9692a7d88f4e0ea2c41.poster.avif?t=1762773645\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/cf149d9c329cc9692a7d88f4e0ea2c41.webm?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/cf149d9c329cc9692a7d88f4e0ea2c41.mp4?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2744\ufe0f <strong>A Living Viking World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a Nordic village filled with secrets: from <strong>snowy forests and longhouses</strong> to <strong>bustling markets and sacred ruins</strong>.<br>Every NPC, noise, and clue hides a piece of the story and sometimes, your enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn to read the environment, or fall victim to it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/4154ab1d6f05e85f36c060bfed4a4199.poster.avif?t=1762773645\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/4154ab1d6f05e85f36c060bfed4a4199.webm?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/4154ab1d6f05e85f36c060bfed4a4199.mp4?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>From West to North | The Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Built on everything players loved about <i>West Hunt</i> and refined through years of feedback, <strong>North Hunt</strong> delivers the next level of social deduction gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">More strategy. More tension. More \u201cDid you just see that?!\u201d moments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/a7985f29b74ae888aa2c1bc5abc8ef57.avif?t=1762773645\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Want early access to chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Become one of the first to test <strong>North Hunt</strong>, help shape its future, and earn exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Sign up for the Closed Beta now</strong> and follow us on socials for devlogs, sneak peeks, and upcoming announcements. [X] NorthHuntGame\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1762773645\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1762773645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because in this village, <strong>every smile hides a sword</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642850?t=1762773645","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3642850?t=1762773645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/e6f3fb7edf594c727373a11ad4d01228d8efd4b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762773645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642850/e6f3fb7edf594c727373a11ad4d01228d8efd4b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762773645","